WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
In this scenario, coolant heats up before the warning light.

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.500
Car Neuron reads blackbox data every second.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Connect to the car. One record every second.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.831
RPM, speed, load and temperature, read together.

5
00:00:15.831 --> 00:00:20.194
The dashboard monitors signals from one vehicle.

6
00:00:20.194 --> 00:00:26.739
The fan stops and heat rises. Group 15 samples into a batch.

7
00:00:26.739 --> 00:00:31.000
Check the safety rule, weather and service history.

8
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.466
The agent compares signals instead of checking a single threshold.

9
00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:44.192
Environment, engine load, or signs of a cooling fault?

10
00:00:44.192 --> 00:00:50.500
A verdict with evidence, recommendations and nearby garages.

11
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.100
An earlier alert in this illustrative scenario; thresholds vary by car.

12
00:00:55.100 --> 00:01:02.100
Understand the car. Understand the driver.

13
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:08.400
Track eyes and head direction, locally in the browser.

14
00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.150
The counter rises while the eyes stay closed.

15
00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:14.300
A local alert without waiting for the agent. Stop safely and rest.

16
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:17.100
Video stays in the tab. No recording or uploads.

17
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:21.000
Only structured JSON events are sent to the agent.

18
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.980
Prototype: no vehicle control, no emergency calls, not safety certified.

19
00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:30.000
Car Neuron. A companion for every journey.
